Error [jet.TraitNotImplemented]: `fn() -> String` isn't `Printable`
  --> tests/ui/checked_text_hole_names_a_function.jet:6:21
    |
  6 |     page: HTML{"<p>{greet}</p>"}
    |                     ^^^^^
 Why: `fn() -> String` is a function, which is code to run; its result is the value that can be `Printable`
 Fix: Call the function and use its result, as `f()`
